   - a dataset larger than 20 posts;
   - exactly 20 posts on a full archive page;
   - a partial final page;
   - first, middle, and final page navigation;
   - complete and non-overlapping archive coverage;
   - regression checks for home, tags, feed, sitemap, and individual-post navigation.

